  "about": "The cut of each film the site publishes. film and poster are the web copies under public/media; cut and length are the cut's label and length as its script states them (null when the cut was made before the scripts); streams are the SHA-256 of its video and audio streams, from ffmpeg's streamhash with the streams copied. scripts/build-motion.mjs publishes a film's credits, contact sheet and script only from the folder in motion/out whose render has these streams, and lists any other cut in motion/out as in review. Replace a web copy, then run node scripts/build-motion.mjs --pin <slug>. offSite lists roster films the site leaves out entirely.",
